[00:23.514] Flying through the city with the speakers up loud
{"扬声器震响，飞驰穿过城市"}
[00:26.119] Speedin' by with the top down
{"敞着篷，极速掠过"}
[00:29.284] Fast lane livin' till they put me in the ground, and I don't wanna stop now
{"快车道人生，直到入土为安，而我现在还不想停下"}
[00:33.667]
[00:34.869] I'll be gone with the click of a finger
{"弹指间我就会消失不见"}
[00:37.786] Say the word, give a call, I'll be comin' back around
{"说一声，打个电话，我就会回来"}
[00:43.437]
[00:46.928] Flying through the city, I got God on my side
{"飞驰穿过城市，上帝站在我这边"}
[00:49.611] But the real world is not far
{"但现实世界并不遥远"}
[00:52.911] Push to the limit, I'll be burning all night, gettin' tailed by a cop car
{"推到极限，整夜燃烧，被警车尾随"}
[00:58.362] Pull away, wind blowin', now I'm cruisin'
{"拉开距离，风吹着，现在我在巡航"}
[01:01.289] Put the past in the past, a new day is comin'
{"把过去留在过去，新的一天即将到来"}
